#, python-brace-format
msgid "Loss budget: {layout_pct} % unaccounted with the parts in the grid (a resistor's loss counts here), against {expected_pct} % expected dielectric loss, at worst at {f_mhz} MHz (|a| {a_db} dB); flagged {limit_pct} points above."
