#, python-brace-format
msgid "Loss budget flagged: {layout_pct} % unaccounted at {f_mhz} MHz (|a| {a_db} dB) is more than {limit_pct} points above the {expected_pct} % expected dielectric loss, with the parts in the grid. A resistor in the chain adds its own loss here; otherwise radiation or power coupled into cut nets is the usual cause; look at the model with `preview`."
